      ],
      "en": "Children, obey your parents in the Lord, for this is right.",
      "ko": "자녀들아 너희 부모를 주 안에서 순종하라 이것이 옳으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b8b8a5b4005bddaecf61e305c11088e3cec4a8630b107937a543ae6f42614b91",
      "translation_text_hash": "99986cb9e6d1dfd75b3469fffbdc2f759f2a13826f592b3dba9b6b9459f45fef",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
