      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EPH",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "Stand therefore, having the utility belt of truth buckled around your waist, and having put on the breastplate of righteousness,",
      "ko": "그런즉 서서 진리로 너희 허리 띠를 띠고 의의 흉배를 붙이고",
      "source_text_hash": "126ad4864db6b4ae514bbf99a900d8e5a2360b57aa46378adf29c105dd538ea5",
      "translation_text_hash": "07f8ad8ae02f2ed06e575ef0372058853fc7c7f0674e1bf6622979bc96413f4e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그런즉 서서 진리로 너희 허리 띠를 띠고 의의 흉배를 붙이고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "07f8ad8ae02f2ed06e575ef0372058853fc7c7f0674e1bf6622979bc96413f4e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EPH:6:15",
      "sequence": 29349,
      "chapter_label": "EPH 6",
      "verse_label": "15",
      "locator": {
        "book": "EPH",
